{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15061","headline":"长至日上公献寿 · 崔琮","name":"长至日上公献寿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"应律三阳首，朝天万国同。\n斗边看子月，台上候祥风。\n五夜钟初动，千门日正融。\n玉阶文物盛，仙仗武貔雄。\n率舞皆羣辟，称觞即上公。\n南山爲圣寿，长对未央宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔琮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15061.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15061","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}